<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>This macro is intended for tamers with Magnetic ID. It will help alot since we dont need to pick up the drops !

What it will do :
Target monster, attack, repeat 24/7

this method is really useful and simple for digimon with fast attack speed and higher level than the enemy monster. It's recommended if you can one hit the enemy monsters !</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы 
Feel free to use this</Comment>
